    - TestLlamaserver_EnableThinking_WireBody: verifies chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking=true and no top-level enable_thinking
    - TestLlamaserver_EnableThinking_Disabled: verifies chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking=false per ADR-010 §9'

